      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 8,
        "line_end": 9,
        "exact_text": "- **Minimize delta** — average standard Euclidean distance between matched cluster centroids and expert points\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_5bca5714182a2ee3ccaf",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 14,
        "line_end": 14,
        "exact_text": "- `citsci_train.csv` — Citizen science annotations (columns: `file_rad`, `x`, `y`)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_05284e4d2535d02d1dcb",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 15,
        "line_end": 16,
        "exact_text": "- `expert_train.csv` — Expert annotations (columns: `file_rad`, `x`, `y`)\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_bd8e94579d0cd3fb0436",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 22,
        "line_end": 22,
        "exact_text": "- `min_samples`: 3–9 (integers, i.e., 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_0c154fb2094de04b749b",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 23,
        "line_end": 23,
        "exact_text": "- `epsilon`: 4-24 (step 2, i.e. 4, 6, 8, ..., 22, 24) (integers)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_97bb7457909b7b889ecd",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 24,
        "line_end": 25,
        "exact_text": "- `shape_weight`: 0.9–1.9 (step 0.1, i.e., 0.9, 1.0, 1.1, ..., 1.8, 1.9)\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_ec0b04d71771ef73be14",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 40,
        "line_end": 40,
        "exact_text": "1. Loop over unique images (using `file_rad` to identify images)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_20624c5cf20ff4a80c88",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 41,
        "line_end": 41,
        "exact_text": "2. For each image, run DBSCAN on citizen science points and compute cluster centroids\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_50f8cd027bd485ffd01f",
      "requirement_type": "CONSISTENCY",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 42,
        "line_end": 42,
        "exact_text": "3. Match cluster centroids to expert annotations using greedy matching (closest pairs first, max distance 100 pixels) based on the standard Euclidean distance (not the custom one)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_e141a5a87e29e0b50229",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 43,
        "line_end": 43,
        "exact_text": "4. Compute F1 score and average delta (average standard Euclidean distance, not the custom one) for each image\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7d0ad9fa30286734454e",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 44,
        "line_end": 44,
        "exact_text": "5. Average F1 and delta across all images\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_92b29261bcf9d7f15b16",
      "requirement_type": "PRESERVATION",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 45,
        "line_end": 46,
        "exact_text": "6. Only keep results with average F1 > 0.5 (meaningful clustering performance)\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_5f6e1c5acba46242bc67",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 48,
        "line_end": 48,
        "exact_text": "- Loop over all unique images from the expert dataset (not just images that have citizen science annotations)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_0be5eded56ac8eeafc07",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 49,
        "line_end": 49,
        "exact_text": "- If an image has no citizen science points, DBSCAN finds no clusters, or no matches are found, set F1 = 0.0 and delta = NaN for that image\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_1d6462eb490eeeeecca3",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 50,
        "line_end": 50,
        "exact_text": "- Include F1 = 0.0 values in the F1 average (all images contribute to the average F1)\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_b55b9b61821cc2b73402",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "HARD",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/mars-clouds-clustering/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 51,
        "line_end": 52,
        "exact_text": "- Exclude delta = NaN values from the delta average (only average over images where matches were found)\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "2cdef7629a2918e8322ceaaec2f2651e357202e15cfb9bc073836441ec92b3d8",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
